      <h2 style="font: 600 var(--type-display-2)/1.08 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -.025em; margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--color-forest); text-wrap: pretty">Priced by framework and estate size</h2>
      <p style="font: 400 18px/1.65 var(--font-body); color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 0 40px; text-wrap: pretty">Indicative sizing. Final quote follows a scoping call with your audit timeline.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:24px">
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border-default);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;">
          <div style="font:500 11px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:.14em">SINGLE FRAMEWORK</div>
          <div style="font:600 20px var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--color-ink)">SOC 2 or ISO 27001</div>
          <div style="font:400 14px/1.6 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);text-wrap:pretty">One framework, one product, first audit cycle. The most common starting point.</div>
          <div style="font:500 12px var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-forest-600);letter-spacing:.06em;margin-top:auto;padding-top:10px">2-3 weeks</div>
