          <div style="font:600 20px var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--color-ink)">Overlapping requirements</div>
          <div style="font:400 14px/1.6 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);text-wrap:pretty">Two or more frameworks tested once and mapped to each, avoiding duplicate engagements.</div>
          <div style="font:500 12px var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-forest-600);letter-spacing:.06em;margin-top:auto;padding-top:10px">4 weeks</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border-default);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;">
          <div style="font:500 11px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:.14em">REGULATED</div>
