          <div style="font:400 14px/1.6 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);text-wrap:pretty">Cardholder or PHI environments with segmentation testing and formal scoping.</div>
          <div style="font:500 12px var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-forest-600);letter-spacing:.06em;margin-top:auto;padding-top:10px">4-6 weeks</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="font: 400 13.5px/1.6 var(--font-body); color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 22px 0 0">Every engagement is quoted after scoping. No per-seat pricing, no surprise change orders, and retests are included for the life of the engagement.</p>
