  </section>
  <section id="case" data-screen-label="Case study" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-default);">
    <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) 28px">
      <div style="font:500 12px var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-forest);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:18px">/ Case study</div>
      <h2 style="font: 600 var(--type-display-2)/1.08 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -.025em; margin: 0 0 40px; color: var(--color-forest); text-wrap: pretty">A health-tech platform, three weeks before fieldwork</h2>
      
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--border-default);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:40px;align-items:flex-start">
        <div style="flex:1 1 380px;max-width:620px">
          <div style="font:500 11px var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-forest);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-bottom:16px">HEALTH-TECH · SERIES A</div>
          <p style="font:500 var(--type-pull-quote)/1.35 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.015em;color:var(--color-ink);margin:0 0 16px;text-wrap:balance">Their previous pentest would have failed the audit, and nobody knew until we read it.</p>
          <p style="font:400 14.5px/1.6 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">The prior report covered the application but omitted the segmentation testing PCI DSS requires. We found it during gap analysis, ran the missing testing, and delivered mapped evidence eight days before fieldwork. The audit passed with no findings on the testing controls.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;min-width:180px">
          <div><div style="font:700 30px var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--color-forest)">3wk</div><div style="font:500 10px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:4px">WARNING BEFORE FIELDWORK</div></div>
          <div><div style="font:700 30px var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--color-forest)">8d</div><div style="font:500 10px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:4px">TO COMPLETE EVIDENCE</div></div>
          <div><div style="font:700 30px var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--color-forest)">0</div><div style="font:500 10px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:4px">AUDIT FINDINGS</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
