          <h3 style="font:600 16px/1.3 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--color-ink)">Will you talk to our auditor?</h3>
          <p style="font:400 13.5px/1.55 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Yes. We join the call and answer methodology and scope questions directly. Auditors generally prefer this to a report passed through a third party.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-default);padding-top:16px">
          <h3 style="font:600 16px/1.3 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--color-ink)">We already have a pentest report. Is it enough?</h3>
          <p style="font:400 13.5px/1.55 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Send it over. We review it against the framework requirements and tell you plainly whether it will hold up.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-default);padding-top:16px">
          <h3 style="font:600 16px/1.3 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--color-ink)">How late can we start?</h3>
          <p style="font:400 13.5px/1.55 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Three weeks before fieldwork is workable for a single framework. Earlier is better because remediation is what takes time.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-default);padding-top:16px">
          <h3 style="font:600 16px/1.3 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--color-ink)">Do you do the audit itself?</h3>
          <p style="font:400 13.5px/1.55 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">No. We are not an audit firm, which is exactly why our evidence is independent. We work alongside whichever assessor you appoint.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
